00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:16.260
Obviously don't take on a classic
of, you know, French literature, if

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:21.510
that's not of interest to you read,
uh, comics read things on sports.

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:26.730
Uh that's I think where anime in the
case of, uh, people interested in

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:31.140
Japanese is kind of like cartoons,
read comic books, whatever you like

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.060
to read, develop that reading habit.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:38.520
Get the brain used to reading used
to converting meaning from written

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:44.100
text, because it's gonna be a
major, major advantage, uh, in life.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:49.860
Uh, professionally, academically,
whatever, but also in terms of

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:53.040
language learning, it's, it's
a powerful, powerful activity.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:57.720
So as you know, I'm very much in favor
of input based learning, build up your

00:09:57.720 --> 00:10:00.120
